Z||000006||Fierokid87||06-08-2001||11:23 PM||||Ok here we go.  Im doing the same conversion to my 87 coupe.  Basically just take the V-6 and the wiring hoses, ECM, and all the stuff that is different between the two cars.  when your done with that then it sould be simple.  I know I dont sound liek I know what Im talking about but trust me.  changing to a V-6 is simple.  So far the hardes part of the conversion is waiting on the engine to come back from the machine shop.   Hoping to have about 190 hp.<P>Scott||||reg||1
